[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] 5.  Now, subtract equation (1) from equation (2) written for x and equation (2) written for x'? Alternatively, we can try to eliminate the terms <x, y> and <x', y>. Let's subtract (2) for x and (2) for x':
