[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] 2. Calculation trap: Not properly setting up the area ratio equations for the similar trapezoids formed by the parallel segment
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] 3. Completeness trap: Forgetting to find x²/100 and then take the greatest integer less than or equal to it
