[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] 4. For the segment x that divides the area equally, use the concept of similar trapezoids. The area above x and the whole trapezoid are similar, and their area ratio is 1:2.
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] 5. Since area ratio = (length ratio)², we can find x in terms of the bases
