[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] 
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] Equate (7b) and (8):
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] (14Y - 18X)/3 = 2X + 2Y
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] Multiply both sides by 3:
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] 14Y - 18X = 6X + 6Y
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] 8Y = 24X
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] Y = 3X   (9b)
