[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] **Pitfall Prediction**:
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] 1. Misunderstanding that the groups change after the score increase: originally promoted might not all be promoted after? Actually, all originally promoted (score>=65) become score>=70, so they remain promoted. The change is that some originally repeaters (score<65) become promoted if their score was between 60 and 64.
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] 2. Forgetting the constraints on S_X (between 60X and 64X) and S_Y (<=59Y) which are crucial.
