[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] For part (b):
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] 1. Similarly, use new averages 79 and 47.
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] 2. Derive S_Y=42Y, S_X=56X+14Y.
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] 3. Set up equation from new promoted average: S_X = 74X + 3P1.
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] 4. Combine with P1=2X+2Y from overall average.
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] 5. Solve to get Y=3X.
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] 6. Check against constraint: S_X=56X+14*3X=98X must be between 60X and 64X, which is false.
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:36 run_experiments.py:122] 7. Conclude no solution.
