[INFO] 09-21 22:29:37 run_experiments.py:122] **Strategy Formulation**: 
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:37 run_experiments.py:122] 1.  Identify the correct formula for mean molecular speed: \( v = \sqrt{\frac{8RT}{\pi M}} \).
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:37 run_experiments.py:122] 2.  Define the constants: R = 8.314 J/mol·K. Assume a standard temperature of T = 298.15 K (room temperature).
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:37 run_experiments.py:122] 3.  Define the molar mass of H₂: M = 2.016 g/mol = 0.002016 kg/mol.
[INFO] 09-21 22:29:37 run_experiments.py:122] 4.  Substitute these values into the numerator of the formula: 8 * R * T.
