[INFO] 09-21 22:29:37 run_experiments.py:122] 12. Alternatively, we can find v_rms,∥ first from ΔE_rms. From step 8, kT = sqrt(2) ΔE_rms. Also, v_rms,∥ = sqrt(kT/m) = sqrt( sqrt(2) ΔE_rms / m ) = ( (sqrt(2) ΔE_rms / m) )^(1/4)? This seems messy. It's better to find T first.
