[INFO] 09-22 03:31:23 run_experiments.py:122] 
[INFO] 09-22 03:31:23 run_experiments.py:122] \[ \left\{\frac{\sqrt{2}}{d}(x\minus{}y): \ x\in S\right\}\]
[INFO] 09-22 03:31:23 run_experiments.py:122] 
[INFO] 09-22 03:31:23 run_experiments.py:122] is an orthonormal system of vectors in  $ \mathcal{H}$ .
