[INFO] 09-22 03:31:23 run_experiments.py:122] 1. For any two minimal saddle pairs (R1, C1) and (R2, C2), define a function f: R1 → R2 such that for each r in R1, f(r) is a row in R2 that dominates r on C2 (using condition (i) of (R2, C2)).
