[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] The average of all participants is  $66$ , that of the promoted  $71$  and that of the repeaters  $56$ . 
[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] However, due to an error in the wording of a question, all scores are increased by  $5$ . At this point
[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] the average of the promoted participants becomes  $75$  and that of the non-promoted  $59$ .
[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] (a) Find all possible values ​​of  $N$ .
[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] (b) Find all possible values ​​of  $N$  in the case where, after the increase, the average of the promoted had become  $79$  and that of non-promoted  $47$ .
