[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] - *Conceptual Trap*: Misinterpreting what makes Kathy happy. She needs all red cards to be adjacent AND all green cards to be adjacent. This means either all 5 cards are the same color, or there's exactly one contiguous block of each color.
