[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] **Strategy Formulation**:
[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] 1. Calculate the total number of ways to select and arrange 5 cards from 10 cards: C(10,5) × 5! ways.
