[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122]       - For r red cards (1 ≤ r ≤ 4), we have C(5,r) ways to select red cards
[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122]       - The arrangement must be either "red block then green block" or "green block then red block" (2 ways)
[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] 3. Sum all favorable outcomes and divide by total outcomes to get probability m/n
