[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] 1. Cauchy-Schwarz inequality: $\left(\int f(x)g(x)dx\right)^2 \leq \left(\int f(x)^2dx\right)\left(\int g(x)^2dx\right)$
