[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] 
[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] The key insight is to view $\int_0^\infty f(x)dx$ in a way that allows us to apply Cauchy-Schwarz effectively by introducing appropriate weight functions.
