[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] **Pitfall Prediction**:
[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] - *Conceptual Trap*: Applying Cauchy-Schwarz directly without proper setup. Simply applying Cauchy-Schwarz to the original integrals won't yield the desired inequality.
[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] - *Calculation Trap*: Making errors when manipulating the integrals or when applying substitutions.
[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] - *Completeness Trap*: Not fully justifying each step, especially when introducing weight functions or making substitutions.
