[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] 1. Rewrite $\int_0^\infty f(x)dx$ by introducing weight functions: $\int_0^\infty f(x)dx = \int_0^\infty f(x) \cdot \frac{x^{1/3}}{x^{1/3}}dx = \int_0^\infty \frac{f(x)}{x^{1/3}} \cdot x^{1/3}dx$
