[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] - *Conceptual Trap*: Forgetting to use the closed formula and trying to compute individual sums, which is inefficient
[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] - *Calculation Trap*: Misapplying the formula for sum of cubes or making algebraic errors when working with the modular equation
