[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] 5. This is still complex, so I'll try a different approach: test small values of n directly and look for patterns
[INFO] 09-22 05:15:09 run_experiments.py:122] 6. For each candidate n, calculate $1^3 + 2^3 + ... + n^3$ using the formula, then check if the remainder when divided by n+5 is 17
