[INFO] 09-22 06:54:53 run_experiments.py:122] 1. Counting the total number of ways to select and arrange 5 cards from 10 cards
[INFO] 09-22 06:54:53 run_experiments.py:122] 2. Counting the number of favorable arrangements where all red cards are adjacent and all green cards are adjacent
[INFO] 09-22 06:54:53 run_experiments.py:122] 3. Calculating the probability as (favorable outcomes)/(total outcomes)
