[INFO] 09-22 06:54:53 run_experiments.py:122] - Completeness Trap: After finding n, we must remember to find the sum of its prime factors, not just identify n itself.
[INFO] 09-22 06:54:53 run_experiments.py:122] - Special Case Trap: We need to check both prime and composite values of a, as they behave differently.
