[INFO] 09-22 06:54:54 run_experiments.py:122] 
[INFO] 09-22 06:54:54 run_experiments.py:122] Answer Choices:
[INFO] 09-22 06:54:54 run_experiments.py:122] (A) 1.911*10^31 Bq
[INFO] 09-22 06:54:54 run_experiments.py:122] (B) 3.719 Bq
[INFO] 09-22 06:54:54 run_experiments.py:122] (C) 113.837 Bq
[INFO] 09-22 06:54:54 run_experiments.py:122] (D) 117.555 Bq
